  "description": "A handsome guy and a beautiful girl who dated back in art high school have gone their separate ways and become actors, but her ex-boyfriend, Seon-Ho, is a famous top star, while Na-Eun is an unknown actress… Is this for real? Far from being more successful than her ex, she’s hit rock bottom and is on the verge of retiring from the entertainment industry when she receives an A-list script. But wait... the male lead in this romantic comedy is her ex-boyfriend? How am I supposed to film a kissing scene with him?!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
